# Browser extension (`extension/`)

- Manifest V3 only (`extension/manifest.json`). Popup + `background.js` service worker. No remote code.
- Public config only in `extension/config.js` (web origin + Supabase URL and **anon** key). Never add the service role or `AI_SERVICE_SECRET`.
- Session handoff: web page `/extension-auth` → extension (`externally_connectable` matches localhost). Fallback: paste session JSON in the popup.
- The extension talks to Supabase with the user session and to the web origin. It must not call FastAPI or Redis.
- Keep permissions minimal (`activeTab`, `storage`, `tabs`). Expand `host_permissions` only when the web origin changes.
- After file changes, reload the unpacked extension on `chrome://extensions`.
